      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "BLUF",
      "role_note": "EXECUTIVE-SUMMARY LAW \u2014 corrects the misconception: AI editor as prompt-to-code -> idea-to-spec, reviewed first.",
      "narration_text": "Here is the whole idea. Most A.I. coding tools turn your prompt straight into code. Kiro turns your idea into a spec first \u2014 requirements, design, tasks \u2014 and you review that plan before a single line is written.",
