      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
      "role_note": "The plan itself: requirements.md / design.md / tasks.md for one feature. Illustrative, captioned.",
      "narration_text": "Here's what that plan looks like. The requirements file holds a user story and acceptance criteria \u2014 including the edge case a rushed build skips: an unknown email gets the same reply, so attackers can't probe for accounts. Then the design, then tasks you tick off. Reading these teaches you how real features are structured.",
