      "act": "SECURITY",
      "role_note": "Team controls: identity and tool governance.",
      "narration_text": "For companies, there are guardrails. Sign-in through I.A.M. Identity Center, single sign-on, and company-wide M.C.P. policies that limit which tools the agent is allowed to reach. The agent only touches what the organization allows.",
