      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "FALSIFIABILITY",
      "role_note": "The tool's own published flaws, and what to do.",
      "narration_text": "But be honest about the tool itself. In 2026, Kiro had its own flaws: a crafted project folder could run code on your machine, and file writes could reach execution-sensitive paths. Both are fixed. So keep Kiro updated \u2014 and if you can't upgrade yet, don't open project folders you don't trust.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
